1
00:00:00,908 --> 00:00:02,078
(Howard:)What does that tell you?

2
00:00:02,243 --> 00:00:07,123
(Penny:)You'd be willing to die a horrible death on
the off chance you'd get to second base.

3
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:10,290
(Bernadette:)We're way past second base.
Right, Howard?

4
00:00:10,877 --> 00:00:15,177
(Howard:)Well, we kind of disagree
about what the bases are.

5
00:00:16,257 --> 00:00:18,847
(Bernadette:)How's your work going, Penny?
Any acting jobs?

6
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:21,260
(Penny:)The last big thing I did
was this production...

7
00:00:21,429 --> 00:00:24,139
(Penny:)...of Diary of Anne Frank
above a bowling alley.

8
00:00:24,307 --> 00:00:27,187
(Penny:)But I think things
might be turning around pretty soon.

9
00:00:27,352 --> 00:00:29,272
Well, great. How come?

10
00:00:29,437 --> 00:00:31,477
(Penny:)Well, promise you won't
make fun of me?

11
00:00:31,647 --> 00:00:33,937
(Leonard:)Of course.
I would never make fun of you.

12
00:00:34,942 --> 00:00:38,362
(Penny:)Okay, well, I went to this psychic
who told me that if I cut my hair...

13
00:00:38,529 --> 00:00:40,529
...I'm gonna get
a national commercial.

14
00:00:40,698 --> 00:00:41,868
[LAUGHING]

15
00:00:42,033 --> 00:00:43,863
What? Seriously?

16
00:00:44,035 --> 00:00:46,705
(Leonard(laughing):)You're getting career advice
from a psychic?

17
00:00:46,871 --> 00:00:50,291
(Howard:)Good job not making fun of her.

18
00:00:50,458 --> 00:00:54,168
She's not one of those phonies, okay?
She wrote a book, has her own website.

19
00:00:54,337 --> 00:00:55,837
(Leonard:)Oh, gee, why didn't you say so?

20
00:00:56,005 --> 00:00:58,635
They don't just let anyone
have a website.

21
00:00:59,133 --> 00:01:02,023
(Penny:)-Why are you being such a jerk?
-You're surprised?

